    <property name="toolTip">
     <string>The Sentinel-1 scenes whose orbits are wanted; only the CHECKED ones are used. A scene is known by its name: a product (.zip, or the manifest.safe inside a .SAFE folder) or a measurement file (s1a-iw1-slc-vv-....tiff or .xml, as in a GMTSAR raw/ folder). Add more with the ... button (several at once; pressing it again adds more), or every scene of a folder with Add all in folder. Hover a file for its full path.</string>
    </property>
